from write_records import add,N,BASE
add('vcd',1,'Broad inquiry and efficient reuse use different operations','Replace a single speed-versus-depth compromise with a division between discovery work and later retrieval.','One common level of compression across this line seems administratively simpler; I have not compared its effect on discovery and reuse separately.', '''Input: fifty assigned applications require substantive original operations and efficient continuing use. Conflict detected: yes. Breadth wants different targets, negative attempts, and exploratory work; efficiency wants fewer repeated operations and shorter retrieval. These wants collide when one summary is asked to do discovery and serve as a reusable decision index.

Conflict decomposition:

| Component | Specific incompatibility | Timing and structure | False-dichotomy result |
|---|---|---|---|
| Source loading | Exact bytes cost reading time | Once per original, then reusable | Not necessary to reread identical receipt bodies |
| New application | Novel targets need case detail | During discovery | Detail can stay in source-linked record |
| Negative case | Failure evidence uses space | Later stops repeated bad attempts | Deleting failure is not the only compression |
| Repeated insight | Reuse can look like another success | At verdict assignment | Reuse can be recorded without extra KEEP |
| Intrinsic interest | No immediate benefit established | Exploratory interval | Preserve as interest without inventing utility |
| Value inference | Context qualifiers lengthen rows | At reuse boundary | Qualifiers belong beside the choice, not in distant prose |
| Competing values | A total rank is compact | Different situations activate different constraints | Conditional partial order is available |
| Provenance | Many originals clutter one index | Archive versus retrieval | Links can preserve access without full duplication |

Historical pattern: not a long-term personal pattern; local source loading and first six records are the observed sequence. The conflict is several resource and representation tensions, not one scalar value clash. The original refers to navigation strategies “above” that are absent from its loaded body; no missing strategy list is invented.

Selected navigation: temporal separation plus representation separation. Discovery retains original procedure products. Reuse stores the scope, changed decision, exception, and source pointer. Both values are served in different operations; neither is declared less important overall. Concrete plan: consolidate after four distinct demonstrated keeps; use the compact entries in the next two decisions; reopen a full record if its condition is unclear.

Success: the next two decisions recover the relevant distinction and exception without redoing the original procedure. Risk: overcompression drops the actual scope. Pivot trigger: a compact entry produces a broader attribution than the full record supports. Checkpoint: every consolidation compares a flat chronology, a theme list, and a decision-keyed table.

Certificate: one compression level is not required by a shared efficiency goal. New-generation detail and retrieval detail have different purposes. The two representations coexist and are linked, so a later compact lookup need not narrow the underlying inquiry. Contrary branch: a small corpus can be easier to scan as chronology; that remains a tested alternative in the following consolidation.''','I now allocate detailed discovery and compact retrieval to separate representations, retaining links between them.','The immediately following consolidation recovers both provenance and exceptions for two later uses in one table instead of rereading the full six-document chronology.','KEEP','Content improved by decomposing eight collisions. Organization changes after this fourth keep; the compact view must retain scope qualifiers.','Compare retrieval under unfamiliar questions; test whether one detailed countercase is enough per compact entry; track cases where chronology remains better.',N+' Expanded to eight conflict components, historical limits, an explicit missing-source-list defect, three candidate organizations, and actual integration into the next consolidation.','The consolidation written immediately after this record uses a decision-keyed table for vcl-1, ve-1, ve-3, and this finding. Its two retrieval exercises produce a constrained-choice interpretation and a pure-interest queue decision without a new value-elicitation pass.')
(BASE/'consolidation-01.md').write_text('''Intended mind change: Make the first four demonstrated changes easier to reuse while preserving what each does and does not establish.

# Four keeps, three organizations

Inputs are only 019-vcl-1, 020-ve-1, 020-ve-3, and 021-vcd-1. Starting organization: six full documents in writing order. This comparison adds no new claim about human psychology.

| Trigger in the next task | Retained change | Exception retained | Provenance |
|---|---|---|---|
| Time spent is used as a value ranking | Condition revealed allocation on offered choices and constraints | A compulsory expenditure does not establish intrinsic preference | 019-vcl-1.md |
| An exploratory thread lacks immediate utility | Keep exploration as a distinct task reason | No automatic KEEP credit or human enjoyment claim | 020-ve-1.md |
| A fascinating assertion enters an assessment | Separate interest, truth status, desired outcome, required execution | Interest can coexist with either endorsement or rejection | 020-ve-3.md |
| Compression would erase source products | Preserve discovery record and create a linked reuse entry | Reopen full record when scope is uncertain | 021-vcd-1.md |

Comparisons executed on two concrete later uses:

1. Input: “The required material takes most of the time, so it must be the learner’s deepest interest.” Chronology: the first record gives the constraint answer but later role/value material is interspersed. Theme list (“Values: attention, curiosity, fidelity”): does not encode the offered-choice exception, so the generated reply from that view overstates the hierarchy. Decision table: the first row returns “required time alone cannot settle deepest interest.” The exception is preserved in the actual answer.
2. Input: “The museum-of-discarded-questions thread has no immediate benefit; remove it or label it useful.” Chronology: ve-1 supplies the reason but requires locating its selection example. Theme list: “curiosity” provides no verdict distinction. Table: row two returns “retain as authorized exploration; no KEEP in advance,” and row three prevents interestingness from becoming truth endorsement.

The decision table is selected for these two retrieval tasks: its keys name the inference being made and its exception remains adjacent. Chronology is retained for inspecting sequence; full records retain procedure products. No measured human reading time or general optimality is claimed.

Actual mind change: This line now consults the decision table for the next queue and value-inference operations and reopens the linked record only when the scope is unclear.

Benefit: Both generated later answers retained the relevant distinction and exception; the theme-only organization lost a material limit in both trials.

Verdict: KEEP

Organization: Content is unchanged; four scope-aware entries replace a theme-only shortcut for retrieval. The comparison found no further improvement among these three views for these two uses, not proof that no better view exists.

Next attempts: Test an unfamiliar trigger; compare alphabetical trigger search with the current table; keep a future conflict that requires reopening two source records.
''')
add('vcd',2,'Candor and social ease can conflict on different dimensions','Determine whether a disagreement needs reduced honesty or a different timing and audience arrangement.','A gentler formulation seems the obvious compromise when candor and social ease conflict, but it may leave the actual disagreement harder to see.', '''Constructed input: an analyst has found a wrong denominator in a colleague’s public chart. The colleague values accurate work and a chance to correct their own draft. A group needs a reliable number before tomorrow’s decision. No real person is identified or contacted.

Conflict: candor wants “the denominator excludes three cases”; social ease wants correction without an unnecessary public attribution of carelessness. These are compatible if the timing allows a private correction before the decision; incompatible if that step delays correcting the group’s active misunderstanding.

Eight decomposition findings: factual correction differs from character judgment; private discussion differs from concealed evidence; attribution differs from accuracy; urgency differs from convenience; author control differs from veto over truth; a first error differs from a pattern; accountability differs from punishment; repair of the chart differs from repair of confidence. Historical facts beyond this one stipulated event are unknown.

Navigation candidates: soften the number claim; delay all correction; immediately announce the colleague’s mistake; send a precise private correction with a decision deadline; update chart provenance and record denominator change; add public uncertainty now while waiting for response. The original’s unspecified strategy list remains absent; these are generated case options, not invented source content.

Selected constructed plan: privately state the numerator/denominator issue and share the corrected calculation now; if the chart is already informing a decision, publicly mark that figure pending correction immediately. The author can supply missing context but cannot be assigned a motive. Success is a corrected shared figure before reliance, with a visible change record. Pivot: no response before decision → correct the shared claim and retain uncertainty about authorship context.

Later application: generated correction is “The current chart uses 12 as the denominator, but the included-case list contains 15; the rate is 8/15, about 53%, rather than 8/12, about 67%. Please flag any exclusion rule I missed.” This keeps the substantive disagreement and creates a falsifier. It is an executed draft, not a delivered intervention.

Certificate: literal conflict between honesty and all social discomfort cannot be resolved by wording alone. The narrower case permits separation of fact, audience, and timing; no evidence establishes the colleague’s actual response. The broad claim that this resolves the relationship stays unresolved.''','The case separates correction, attribution, timing, and audience. A helpful draft exists; actual relational improvement is unobserved.','The constructed draft preserves a checkable correction and room for relevant omitted context.','UNRESOLVED','Content improves over “be gentler” but its efficient organization is the same component separation already credited in vcd-1. No extra KEEP.','Test a real denominator dispute if supplied; compare correction while decision is already underway; vary whether private contact is available.',N+' Eight conflict components, six options, explicit pivot, and a concrete subsequent draft.')
add('vcd',3,'Exploration can consume its own subject','Test whether scoring every interesting thread for usefulness undermines the intended pure exploration operation.','Adding a benefit field to every exploratory fragment seems consistent with the program’s demand for beneficial change, though it imposes an immediate judgment.', '''Input: the allocated fun/exploration procedure expressly includes purposeless tangents; the parent program evaluates actual changes and benefits. Conflict detected: yes, at different times. Curiosity wants room to follow a thread before its relevance is known. Evidence discipline wants no unsupported success claim after the attempt.

Decomposition across eight concrete collisions: preapproved usefulness deletes surprising tangents; unlimited tangents crowd out required work; scoring novelty can reward obscurity; scoring output volume rewards padding; insisting on action substitutes behavior for changed attention; refusing all evaluation prevents learning from the attempt; a dead end can clarify a boundary without yielding a recipe; an entertaining analogy can still make a wrong inference.

Temporal pattern: candidate generation and post-application judgment occur at different stages. Historical pattern is limited to this run. False dichotomy: no need to choose either pure utility maximization or entirely unaccountable wandering. The original’s missing navigation taxonomy is not supplied as an invented list.

Selected approach: reserve a bounded exploration pass with no intermediate KEEP score, then report thread, dead end, changed understanding, and actual consequence. Criterion: a subsequent selection can retain pure interest while benefit remains unspecified. Pivot: if four pulls return only familiar associations, end that thread and retain its dead-end note; if the thread reveals a testable causal claim, separate that claim from the analogy.

Eight concrete next-thread classifications: discarded questions → pure interest allowed; calendar-as-map → test representation; trust-as-weather → analogy only; dopamine from checkmarks → empirical claim needing evidence; changing role labels → working-state application; surprise ranking → candidate heuristic only; unanswered question collection → unresolved yield; recurring poetic refrains → stop when no new distinction.

Later use: funr-2 begins with a permission to keep a question as a question; it gets no provisional KEEP. This is a direct application of the already kept multi-terminus task map, not a newly demonstrated benefit.''','The timing of evaluation matters, but the operative distinction repeats ve-1 and vcd-1.','The exploration slot remains available while unsupported benefit credit is withheld.','UNRESOLVED','Content retains a legitimate value conflict. Organization uses discovery then evaluation; it adds no new kept principle beyond the first consolidation.','Compare fixed and event-based exploration endings; try an uninteresting but useful thread; test a curiosity score only after a trace is complete.',N+' Eight collisions and eight downstream thread decisions.')
